LongHorizon-Harness
arXiv:2608.01964

The Manage, Execute, Audit primitives in `packages/core/src/mea.ts` (task
state kept outside the executor, advanced only by environment-verified
evidence, with a bounded subtask contract per round) follow the design
described in the LongHorizon-Harness paper. The implementation is Mouse's own;
the paper is cited as the source of the approach.
